      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتقد الدَّرَاهِمَ</span></b>  <i>He received the money,</i> or
<i>pieces of money;</i> (Lth, S, L, Msb, K;) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الثَّمَنَ</span> <i>the price.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See 1. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتقد</span> <i>It</i>
(a worm) <i>ate</i> the trunk of a tree, <i>and rendered</i> it
<i>hollow.</i> (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <i>He</i> (a boy) <i>grew up into
manhood.</i> (K.)

